*> vybe-test: cobol/binary_comp_types/binary_comp3_two_digits_precision
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_binary_comp_types.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 PRICE PIC 9(5)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 19.99.
01 QTY PIC 9(3) COMP VALUE 3.
01 TOTAL PIC 9(7)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MULTIPLY PRICE BY QTY GIVING TOTAL.
    DISPLAY TOTAL.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING TOTAL DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "59.97"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [59.97] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

